# Intermediate objects emitted by each ctest fixture's build.py. Only the
# linked ELF fixture is tracked, because the boot test needs the ELF on a
# machine that may have no zig/WSL toolchain to rebuild it with.
#
# This rule lives here, matched by pattern, rather than as a copy of the same
# two lines in every services/ctest-*/ directory. Eight of the nine fixtures
# carried that per-directory copy and ctest-ctty did not — so its main.o was
# committed and stayed committed, contradicting the very comment its siblings
# were repeating. A rule replicated per directory is a rule a new directory
# opts out of by simply not having it.
ctest-*/main.o
